function_v0.doc:
One instance per Templar vault. `factory` decides which vaults may allocate;
`cap_authority` alone sets the protocol cap; `keeper` alone may call `harvest`;
`withdrawal_period` is the Templar vault's cooldown, in seconds, shown to the API.
`InvalidConfig` unless `templar` answers `proxy_view` with `asset` and `share_token` as
its asset and share token.
